PARSFILE
#FullDataName Vehicle with Loads, Sensors, Trailer, etc.`D-Class, Sedan 2017: w/ Aero Forces`D-Class
#VehCode Ind_Ind
#CheckBox0 0    
#CheckBox1 0    

symbol_push <<hitch_x>> 0
symbol_push <<hitch_y>> 0
symbol_push <<hitch_z>> 0
iunit 1
PARSFILE Vehicles\Assembly\Vehicle_1b38eeba-7001-4482-b250-36042e0d8c41.par
#BlueLink0 Vehicle: Assembly`D-Class, Sedan 2017 (Transparent, No Interior)` D-Class` , Lead Unit`Vehicle_1b38eeba-7001-4482-b250-36042e0d8c41

ADD_REFERENCE_FRAME LeadUnitPayloads
SET_EULER_ANGLES YAW_PITCH_ROLL
SET_X_NAME Xo
WRT_Xo
ANI_Xo
SET_Y_NAME Yo
WRT_Yo
ANI_Yo
SET_Z_NAME Zo
WRT_Zo
ANI_Zo
SET_YAW_NAME Yaw
WRT_Yaw
ANI_Yaw
SET_PITCH_NAME Pitch
WRT_Pitch
ANI_Pitch
SET_ROLL_NAME Roll_E
WRT_Roll_E
ANI_Roll_E
PARSFILE Output\Sensors\MoSen_adadcfc9-3356-4974-ac57-1db758def3b6.par
#BlueLink5 Positions, Velocities, and Accelerations`Aero Reference Point` ` , Miscellaneous`MoSen_adadcfc9-3356-4974-ac57-1db758def3b6

#BlueLink6 ` , Miscellaneous` , Miscellaneous` , Miscellaneous`

*IMAGE_TYPE PASS_THROUGH
*IMAGE_PASS_THROUGH Animator\Vehicles\AniVeh_f2dbf3b6-68ed-4f69-9064-eaa72ebcf53c.png

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example shows a D-Class sedan with a transparent body animation shape and no interior animation shapes.
